From: gta4xl Linux port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: exynos9611: add firmware Panfrost DVFS and cooling

Expose ACPM domain 4 with seven calibrated OPPs from 260 to 683 MHz.
Keep voltage, PLL, mux and divider writes in Samsung firmware. Validate
its live table before clock publication and read the hardware clock after
each request. Retain the physical gate as the clock parent.

Use frequency-only Panfrost OPPs without a Linux-controlled regulator.
Require cooling registration for the firmware-managed variant, with
staged caps at 60/70/78/85 C. Preserve critical and hardware trips.
Exclude the firmware's higher characterization points. Account for the
firmware's rounded PLL names and zero-status replies, and verify physical
clock readback after Panfrost transitions.

---

